// Canonical source: an interface's default method answers a class that has
// no member of that name, through a parameter of the interface's type.
// Answer: "hi".
interface Greeter { section [public] { String Hello() { return "hi"; } String Name(); } }
class Bob : Object, Greeter { section [public] { String Name() { return "bob"; } } }
String Say(Greeter g) { return g.Hello(); }
return Say(new Bob());
